{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_01",
      "hash": "61867d565a832009",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "宝可梦似乎\\n睡得很舒服的样子。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_02",
      "hash": "61867a565a831af0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要使用宝可梦之笛吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_03",
      "hash": "61867b565a831ca3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]\\n使用了宝可梦之笛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_04",
      "hash": "618680565a832522",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡比兽醒了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_07",
      "hash": "61867f565a83236f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡比兽看了看[VAR TRNAME(0000)]……\\n然后流下了口水！！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_01",
      "hash": "dd4ceab8a4c8f45a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？：[VAR TRNAME(0000)]～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_02",
      "hash": "dd4ce9b8a4c8f2a7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "富士：我把宝可梦之笛给你时，\\n忘记告诉你一件事……"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_03",
      "hash": "dd4ce8b8a4c8f0f4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……哎呀？噢，\\n时机刚刚好。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_05",
      "hash": "dd4ce6b8a4c8ed8e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡比兽这种宝可梦，\\c\\n会把睡醒后睁开眼\\n最先看到的东西误认为食物，\\r\\n而因此发起攻击。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_06",
      "hash": "dd4ce5b8a4c8ebdb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "为了避免被它袭击的危险，\\n请你通过对战让它冷静下来。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_07",
      "hash": "dd4ce4b8a4c8ea28",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "击败它之后它会变温顺，\\n这样你就能和平时一样捕获它喽。"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_06",
      "hash": "61867e565a8321bc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡比兽还没睡醒，\\n迷迷糊糊地袭击了过来！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_05",
      "hash": "618681565a8326d5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡比兽冷静下来了。\\n它打了个大哈欠之后……\\r\\n走向了山的深处！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_08",
      "hash": "dd4ce3b8a4c8e875",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "富士老人：没想到啊，[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n你真是太出色了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_09",
      "hash": "dd4ce2b8a4c8e6c2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "富士老人：哎呀，[VAR TRNAME(0000)]。\\n真是遗憾啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_10",
      "hash": "dd4965b8a4c5dc84",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "将来你可能还会遇到其它\\n像刚才那只卡比兽那样\\r\\n会袭击训练家的宝可梦。\\c\\n这样的宝可梦\\n要击败它之后捕获唷！\\c\\n记住了吗？\\n先击败再捕获唷！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_11",
      "hash": "dd4966b8a4c5de37",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那么，再见了！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_020_max",
      "hash": "af6dc9a4f7b39c54"
    }
  ]
}
